{"video_id": "AGNrqAdizGg", "channel_id": "UC2ZlAXrNcDak9VFy-yBrvGg", "fetched_at": "2026-11-25T03:40:31.380789+00:00", "fetch_tool": "yt-dlp 2026.08.19", "caption_track_type": "auto_generated", "segments": [{"start_seconds": 0.0, "end_seconds": 4.28, "text": "Flutter short number 19."}, {"start_seconds": 2.6, "end_seconds": 6.08, "text": "We've learned that Dart supports const"}, {"start_seconds": 4.28, "end_seconds": 7.92, "text": "constructors."}, {"start_seconds": 6.08, "end_seconds": 9.88, "text": "But does writing const actually make a"}, {"start_seconds": 7.92, "end_seconds": 11.56, "text": "Flutter app faster?"}, {"start_seconds": 9.88, "end_seconds": 13.4, "text": "Sometimes."}, {"start_seconds": 11.56, "end_seconds": 15.08, "text": "The reason is more specific than you"}, {"start_seconds": 13.4, "end_seconds": 17.4, "text": "might expect."}, {"start_seconds": 15.08, "end_seconds": 19.52, "text": "Imagine a counter screen."}, {"start_seconds": 17.4, "end_seconds": 21.68, "text": "It has a title saying my counter, and"}, {"start_seconds": 19.52, "end_seconds": 23.44, "text": "below it a number that changes whenever"}, {"start_seconds": 21.68, "end_seconds": 25.44, "text": "we press a button."}, {"start_seconds": 23.44, "end_seconds": 28.4, "text": "When the parent widget rebuilds, Flutter"}, {"start_seconds": 25.44, "end_seconds": 30.4, "text": "receives new widget configurations."}, {"start_seconds": 28.4, "end_seconds": 32.32, "text": "Without const, the code may create"}, {"start_seconds": 30.4, "end_seconds": 34.08, "text": "another text widget for the unchanged"}, {"start_seconds": 32.32, "end_seconds": 36.96, "text": "title."}, {"start_seconds": 34.08, "end_seconds": 39.0, "text": "Now make that title const text."}, {"start_seconds": 36.96, "end_seconds": 41.28, "text": "Dart can reuse the same constant widget"}, {"start_seconds": 39.0, "end_seconds": 43.16, "text": "instance across rebuilds."}, {"start_seconds": 41.28, "end_seconds": 45.2, "text": "Why does that matter?"}, {"start_seconds": 43.16, "end_seconds": 46.8, "text": "During the element update process,"}, {"start_seconds": 45.2, "end_seconds": 48.96, "text": "Flutter checks whether the incoming"}, {"start_seconds": 46.8, "end_seconds": 51.6, "text": "widget is the exact same object as the"}, {"start_seconds": 48.96, "end_seconds": 53.92, "text": "existing widget configuration."}, {"start_seconds": 51.6, "end_seconds": 55.64, "text": "If it is, Flutter can skip updating that"}, {"start_seconds": 53.92, "end_seconds": 57.36, "text": "child element through the normal parent"}, {"start_seconds": 55.64, "end_seconds": 59.2, "text": "update path."}, {"start_seconds": 57.36, "end_seconds": 61.56, "text": "That may save work for an entire"}, {"start_seconds": 59.2, "end_seconds": 64.12, "text": "unchanged child subtree."}, {"start_seconds": 61.56, "end_seconds": 65.84, "text": "But notice what we did not say."}, {"start_seconds": 64.12, "end_seconds": 67.64, "text": "Const does not stop the parent from"}, {"start_seconds": 65.84, "end_seconds": 69.52, "text": "rebuilding."}, {"start_seconds": 67.64, "end_seconds": 71.52, "text": "And it does not mean Flutter caches the"}, {"start_seconds": 69.52, "end_seconds": 73.48, "text": "screen as an image."}, {"start_seconds": 71.52, "end_seconds": 75.68, "text": "The changing counter value cannot be"}, {"start_seconds": 73.48, "end_seconds": 77.2, "text": "const because that number is only known"}, {"start_seconds": 75.68, "end_seconds": 79.28, "text": "at runtime."}, {"start_seconds": 77.2, "end_seconds": 81.2, "text": "And even a const widget may still need"}, {"start_seconds": 79.28, "end_seconds": 83.4, "text": "rendering work if its layout constraints"}, {"start_seconds": 81.2, "end_seconds": 85.88, "text": "change, or if an inherited dependency"}, {"start_seconds": 83.4, "end_seconds": 88.36, "text": "causes its element to rebuild."}, {"start_seconds": 85.88, "end_seconds": 90.8, "text": "Let's compare two cases."}, {"start_seconds": 88.36, "end_seconds": 93.88, "text": "First, text displaying hello Flutter,"}, {"start_seconds": 90.8, "end_seconds": 96.16, "text": "created again its parent builds."}, {"start_seconds": 93.88, "end_seconds": 99.72, "text": "Second, const text displaying hello"}, {"start_seconds": 96.16, "end_seconds": 101.32, "text": "Flutter, reused as the same object."}, {"start_seconds": 99.72, "end_seconds": 103.88, "text": "The second case can avoid some"}, {"start_seconds": 101.32, "end_seconds": 105.72, "text": "unnecessary element updates."}, {"start_seconds": 103.88, "end_seconds": 108.68, "text": "But adding const everywhere will not"}, {"start_seconds": 105.72, "end_seconds": 110.68, "text": "automatically fix a slow application."}, {"start_seconds": 108.68, "end_seconds": 112.6, "text": "Often, bigger improvements come from"}, {"start_seconds": 110.68, "end_seconds": 115.08, "text": "moving state closer to the widgets that"}, {"start_seconds": 112.6, "end_seconds": 116.92, "text": "change, splitting large widget trees,"}, {"start_seconds": 115.08, "end_seconds": 118.12, "text": "and avoiding expensive work inside"}, {"start_seconds": 116.92, "end_seconds": 119.36, "text": "build."}, {"start_seconds": 118.12, "end_seconds": 121.28, "text": "And how do we know whether an"}, {"start_seconds": 119.36, "end_seconds": 123.88, "text": "optimization helped?"}, {"start_seconds": 121.28, "end_seconds": 126.08, "text": "Measure it with Flutter DevTools."}, {"start_seconds": 123.88, "end_seconds": 128.52, "text": "Watch rebuild activity and frame times"}, {"start_seconds": 126.08, "end_seconds": 131.36, "text": "before and after the change."}, {"start_seconds": 128.52, "end_seconds": 134.56, "text": "So, remember the mental model."}, {"start_seconds": 131.36, "end_seconds": 136.52, "text": "Const enables canonical widget objects."}, {"start_seconds": 134.56, "end_seconds": 137.96, "text": "Widget identity can help Flutter skip"}, {"start_seconds": 136.52, "end_seconds": 139.84, "text": "updates."}, {"start_seconds": 137.96, "end_seconds": 142.84, "text": "But, const does not guarantee fewer"}, {"start_seconds": 139.84, "end_seconds": 145.04, "text": "repaints or higher frames per second."}, {"start_seconds": 142.84, "end_seconds": 147.2, "text": "In the next short, we'll learn Dart null"}, {"start_seconds": 145.04, "end_seconds": 149.08, "text": "safety and why a question mark can"}, {"start_seconds": 147.2, "end_seconds": 151.68, "text": "prevent an entire class of runtime"}, {"start_seconds": 149.08, "end_seconds": 151.68, "text": "errors."}]}